#
# CT7 counter-example (Don't): a projection whose disclosure sensitivity is BELOW its
# source's (source gmeow:sensitivityConfidential rank 2; projection
# gmeow:sensitivityPublic rank 0) authorized ONLY by a BARE, UNREVIEWABLE
# gmeow:DeclassificationAct — one that asserts gmeow:declassifies but carries NEITHER a
# reviewing invocation (gmeow:wasGeneratedBy) NOR an authorizing agent
# (gmeow:wasAssociatedWith). area-5 requires an EXPLICIT, REVIEWABLE declassification act,
# and absence of review never implies a legitimate drop. The unattributed act does NOT
# satisfy gmeow:SecurityMonotonicityConstraint's reviewable-act existential (→
# shacl.SPARQLConstraintComponent) and the act itself violates the DeclassificationAct
# reviewability carriers' sh:minCount 1 on gmeow:wasGeneratedBy / gmeow:wasAssociatedWith
# (→ shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent). Triggers declass-unreviewed.rq (→ ce:leakyProj).
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ce:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counter-examples/embedding-projection/> .

ce:secretPack a gmeow:InformationObject ;
    gmeow:contentDigest  "blake3:sec0000011112222333344445555666677778888999900001111222233334444" ;
    gmeow:hasSensitivity gmeow:sensitivityConfidential .

ce:leakyProj a gmeow:EmbeddingProjection ;
    gmeow:projectionSource       ce:secretPack ;
    gmeow:hasVectorSpaceContract ce:leakyVsc ;
    gmeow:hasSensitivity         gmeow:sensitivityPublic .

# The BARE act: declassifies edge only, NO gmeow:wasGeneratedBy, NO gmeow:wasAssociatedWith.
# An unattributed act is not reviewable, so it warrants nothing.
ce:bareDeclassAct a gmeow:DeclassificationAct ;
    gmeow:declassifies ce:leakyProj .
